  "claim_scope": "Label-free, one-sided thermodynamic perturbation from the force-capable AM1-BCC/OBC-II/ACE solution ensemble to the energy-only AM1-BCC/CHA-GB/PBSA cavity-dispersion endpoint. The target retains the same gas-phase MLIP. This frozen pilot tests endpoint overlap and numerical feasibility only; its 30 fs parent trajectories cannot establish equilibrium, conformer mixing, chemical accuracy, or product certification.",
